{"ASK_WILL_ROB","reg=crime|st=careful,hostile",{"Not unless you're carrying something that belongs to my employer - are you?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_WILL_ROB","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Spent eight years making a list of what I'd do outside - this wasn't on it - yet"}},
{"ASK_WINTER","",{"Cold, mostly - and long","Hard if you're not ready - easy if you are","Depends, some years it's mud, some years it's six inches of ice"}},
