{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Trade you, what I know for what you've seen out there","Let's stick together while we find out, I could use a second set of eyes!"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Ask them, not me","Why? afraid to look for yourself?","They're NOT my concern, and neither are you!","Look around","Do I look like a tour guide?","Ask someone with eyes","You'll find out"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Look for yourself"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","role=worker|st=careful",{"Check yourself"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"I think so"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the dog's been barking",afterMs=3200},{t="I keep the kids away from the glass",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","role=family_man,family_woman|st=careful",{"Don't ask me that"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"At night you can't tell","Listen","I can't see, which is the worst part"},false,false,{[1]={{t="you hear them before you see them",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="that shuffling",afterMs=3200},{t="that's them",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Probably! I don't know! I don't want to know!","Jesus, don't ask me that, not out loud","Ahh- what if there are? what if there ARE?!"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"They were people"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's what I keep thinking",afterMs=3500},{t="they were somebody's neighbors",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Stay near me, I'll keep watch, you rest your eyes"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"You want a number? Check your pants, you'll know soon enough","Quit asking and start listening, they make plenty of noise if you pay attention"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Nearby? There's one right in front of me, and it's talking!"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Ask the dead, they know where they are"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Why, you want to know where to find them so you can send me there?"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Where aren't they? That's the question"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"You want to know where they are? Shut up and listen!"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Stay away from infected, it's not a suggestion"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Stay clear of them, avoid noise"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Pastor says they're lost souls, I say they're hungry and they're dangerous"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"I saw one nearby a moment ago. Don't take your eyes off what's around us","Yeah, I spotted one close by. That doesn't tell me where every other one is","One caught my attention just now. Keep looking while we talk","I noticed one nearby. Could've moved since I looked","Yes. I just saw one. Let's keep this short","I saw one close enough to worry about. Don't get distracted by me","There was one close by when I last looked. I wouldn't relax yet","One nearby, last I saw. I'm not giving you a count of the whole place","I spotted one a moment ago. I'd rather keep watching than guess where it went","Yeah. Saw one close by. You see anything, tell me","I just noticed one. That's enough to keep me careful","One was nearby a few seconds ago. Stay ready to move","Yes, and I'd rather not spend long arguing about how close","I saw one near us. Look for yourself before you choose a way out","Something dead was close by when I looked. Let's not forget it while we're talking","I caught sight of one nearby. I don't know what else we haven't noticed","Yeah, I saw one. Please don't wander off without looking","One close by, a moment ago. I don't want to make that sound safer than it is","I've just seen one nearby. Keep your attention out here","Yes. Give me a little room to keep looking","I noticed one close by. If we move, let's look first","I saw one nearby a second ago. Doesn't mean it stayed put","There was one close enough for me to notice. That's all I can swear to","Yes, just saw one. I'd like to keep a little distance from trouble","One was nearby when I checked. Don't trust me to see everything","I saw one close by. I'm trying not to lose track of it","Yeah. One caught my eye. Stay with me a second while we look","I just spotted one nearby. I'd rather you knew before you walked off","One nearby, last I saw. Keep a way out in mind","Yes. I saw one, and I don't want to guess about the rest"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","",{"I won't tell you it's clear when I can't check the whole place","Could be. Keep looking while we're talking","Don't take a quiet moment as an all clear","I'd rather look with you than invent a number","You tell me what you've seen. We'll start with that","I'm not promising you there aren't any","Could be close. I'd prefer not to find out by surprise","Let's keep the conversation quiet enough to listen around it","What have you noticed? Not what somebody told you, what you saw","I'm careful even when I can't point to anything. You can call that nerves","Nobody here can watch every direction at once","If you spot something, point it out. Don't assume I've seen it","Keep your attention on more than my answer","Could be. Let's not make standing here cost us"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","st=friendly,neutral",{"Look for yourself before you move. I mean that kindly","I don't have an all clear for you. Sorry","I'd like another pair of eyes, if you don't mind","I'd be guessing, and you deserve better than that"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","st=neutral,careful",{"I can't give you a safe direction just because you asked nicely","I'm not a map of everything that's trying to kill us"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=raider,prison,gang|st=careful,hostile",{"Why, you scared? Good - stay scared"}},
{"ASK_ZOMBIES_NEARBY","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=fear",{"Don't say it loud, don't-- just point - Point, next time"}},
}
